    "law": "Hydrostatic equilibrium gives p_small = p_large + rho*g*h. Piston equilibrium gives p_large = p_atm + M*g/A_large and p_small = p_atm + F/A_small. Therefore F = A_small*(M*g/A_large + rho*g*h). With A_small = 0.002 m² and A_large = 0.08 m², F = 294 + 24.99 = 318.99 N, directed downward.",
